 {:section "Tier-B actors (each: ADR + manifest + cells + lex)" :item "kadode 門出" :purpose "**labour-resignation concierge + 使者 (退職代行)** — the labour-liberation worker-EXIT sibling of the legal-concierge lineage (toritsugi 取次 / kurashimori 暮らし守 / tasuke 助), reusing their UPL-bounded default-self-submit pattern + hinagata 雛形 for the document layer. Helps a worker resign with dignity (門出 = setting out on a new path), grounded in real JP labour law, and **RELAYS the worker's already-formed unilateral resignation as a 使者** (民法627 = unilateral right, employer consent NOT required). **G1 = 使者 not 代理人**: it NEVER negotiates terms/severance/settlements (弁護士法72条 非弁行為禁止) — any matter needing negotiation (未払い賃金/退職条件/示談/損害賠償) is routed to a labour union (団体交渉, 労組法6) or a lawyer; **the UPL boundary is enforced in code** (`recommend_route`/`build_relay` refuse+escalate) **and proven by tests**, not just documented. The charter-clean, **free** inversion of a commercial 退職代行 業者. `labor-exit-ontology` (scenario↔ground↔route↔risk); 10 scenarios / 12 real labour-law grounds (民法627/628/626・労基法137/15-2/16/5/24/39・労組法6・弁護士法72・雇用保険法7, each w/ e-Gov URL) / 4-rung escalation ladder (self→使者→union→lawyer) / 5 employer 引き止め risk-patterns each countered by a ground; `generate.py` renders the worker's OWN docs (退職届/願/即時/内容証明/有給, 一身上の都合 only — never a demand), content-addressed; PII via himotoki envelope; relay UNSENT (G7) + no-server-key. Lexicons `com.etzhayyim.kadode.{resignationRelay,escalation}`; pure-stdlib pywasm (`analyze`/`datoms`/`coverage`/`generate`/`relay`) + EAVT datom-emit + 26 tests green (incl. the UPL-invariant + relay-refusal)" :status "🟡 R0" :adr "2606112238" :date "06-11"}
