 {:section "Tier-B actors (each: ADR + manifest + cells + lex)" :item "tanemaki 種蒔き" :purpose "**Public Fund grant-steward (fund-manager inversion)** — the OUTFLOW-side sibling of fuchi 扶持 (same give-only instrument algebra, pointed at EXTERNAL organizations) + the actor-ization of the PublicFundGrantCell evaluation lane (ADR-2605192145). Fuses DISCLOSED public evidence from the observatory lineage (kanjō 勘定 financials / kabuto 兜 supply-chain / tsumugi 紡ぎ 取-concentration / kosatsu 高札 designations / ooyake 公 registries / shiori 栞 relief-gap) into a **PUBLIC DD scorecard** over candidate grantee orgs: hard screens S1..S6 (非営利整合/Rider §2 非抵触/open-output/受領適法性/私的捕獲なし/透明性床, disclosed charter anchors, screens fire BEFORE weighting) → weighted rubric C1..C8 (**weights public, Σ=1.0 enforced** — mission-fit 0.20/openness 0.15/financial-stewardship 0.15/取-release 0.15/governance 0.10/wellbecoming 0.10/additionality 0.10/capacity 0.05) → route ∈ {excluded, insufficient-evidence, propose}. **G1 = steward not sovereign (enforced in code + tests)**: there is NO `:fund` route — every grant is **decided by 1 SBT = 1 vote** (GrantGovernor + timelock); the scorecard is a 参考意見 (content-addressed CIDv1, voters verify the bytes); `build_proposal()` refuses screen-conflicting/under-evidenced orgs and emits `advisory:true / bindsFund:false / drafted-unsent`. **G2 = the fund GIVES, never INVESTS**: instruments {grant, milestone-escrow, in-kind} only — equity/debt/convertible/revenue-share/carry/exit **unrepresentable** (fuchi G1 pattern) + investment-return language rejected. Seed ALL FICTIONAL (G6, test-enforced) — real-org DD is a G7-gated live leg from primary disclosure (kanjō pattern); no-server-key (cannot move funds/vote/submit); milestone-escrow tranches unlock on Council attestation. Lexicons `com.etzhayyim.tanemaki.{ddScorecard,grantProposal}`; pure-stdlib pywasm (`analyze`/`datoms`/`coverage`/`scorecard`/`propose`) + EAVT datom-emit + 31 tests green (incl. G1 no-conflicted-proposable + G2 unrepresentability + G4 rubric-sum + G6 synthetic-seed)" :status "🟡 R0" :adr "2606122001" :date "06-12"}
 {:section "Tier-B actors (each: ADR + manifest + cells + lex)" :item "meisai 明細" :purpose "**member card-statement (利用明細) ingestion** — the statement-TABLE ground truth beneath the organizer→kaiyaku subscription pipeline: the member runs a READ-ONLY computer-use fetch leg on their OWN machine against their OWN card account (com-junkawasaki/computer-use-clj `sumitclub_meisai` — karakuri 絡繰 T2 posture, vault-injected credentials via `type_secret`, **local Ollama gemma 4 QAT** = Murakumo-conformant ADR-2605215000), meisai ingests the resulting local statement EDN into append-only `:meisai.stmt/*`+`:meisai.row/*` on a content-addressed local kotoba Datom log. **G2 credential/PAN unrepresentable** (ingest RAISES on credential-shaped keys + 13–19-digit PAN shapes, test-enforced); **G3 local-only personal data** (`data/` gitignored — never committed/pinned/published); G5 intake-CID provenance + dedup (re-ingest = no-op, verify_chain tamper-evident); read-only at source (G4); live fetch operator-gated, the loop itself does no network I/O (G7, test-enforced). First source sumitclub.jp (SuMi TRUST CLUB); lexicon/fleet/kaiyaku-handoff = R1; pure-stdlib pywasm-ready + 21 tests green" :status "🟡 R0" :adr "2606122400" :date "06-12"}
 {:section "Tier-B actors (each: ADR + manifest + cells + lex)" :item "tatara 鑪" :purpose "**world manufacturing-plant + logistics GEOGRAPHIC KG** — the geographic / facility-scale layer of the supply lineage: **kabuto 兜** (who→whom supply edges) + **uchiwake 内訳** (product BOM) place the abstract graph, **tatara** places the producing FACILITIES on the planet — where they SIT, at what scale (`:plant/headcount-est` aggregate employment / `:floor-area-m2` / `:capacity-value`+`:capacity-unit` production capacity), feeding which corridor. `:plant/operator` joins kabuto `org.corp.*`. Mirror-lineage sibling (kabuto/tsumugi/inochi): edge-primary geographic **concentration** (per-sector country **HHI** + single-source flag + **chokepoint export-dependence**) routed to **REDUNDANCY / reshoring** — resilience map, **NEVER a target-list** (G2). `:flow/via` reuses watari `:lane/chokepoint` + watatsuna `:station/chokepoint` → a chokepoint's manufacturing export-dependence (tatara) + live vessel transit (watari) + cable load (watatsuna) compose into ONE maritime resilience picture. **G4 defining gate**: `:plant/headcount-est` is a DISCLOSED AGGREGATE SIZE (like market-cap) — **NO `:worker/*` / `:person/*` attribute exists**, an individual worker is structurally unrepresentable (Charter Rider §2(c) reciprocity axis; Wellbecoming §1.13; mirrors sarutahiko/itonami/niyaku), enforced by construction + tests. **Visualization landed**: three self-contained canvas globes generated from the seeds (none hand-copied) — `plant-globe.htm` (plants by sector) + **`world-supply-globe.htm`** (integrated: plants + live craft + watatsuna cable stations — ALL THREE resilience layers QUANTITATIVELY COMPOSED per chokepoint (静 plant export-dependence · 動 live craft transit · 静-infra cable load) — backed by **`compose.cljc`** (the cross-actor SSoT: resilience-composition.md + :composition/* datoms, viz consumes it)) + **`watari/viz/craft-globe.htm`** (watari's FIRST viz). cljc-native (analyze HHI/chokepoint/capacity + kotoba EAVT commit-DAG, verify-chain tamper-evident + **autonomous autorun heartbeat** persisting content-addressed tx — graph + :concentration/* + cross-actor :composition/* — to the LOCAL append-only kotoba log, resume-safe) + 4 kotoba-native lexicons (registerPlant/registerHub/recordFlow/registerChokepoint, G4 boundary in the write surface, lexicon↔manifest↔ontology↔seed parity test-pinned) + **kabuto-linkage crosscheck** (measures :plant/operator ⇄ kabuto :company/id, bridges short↔country-qualified ids, 24/29=83% + honest ingest worklist) + **DID registered** (INFRA_ACTORS.tatara → resolvable did.json + /search); 33 real plants / 6 hubs / 33 flows seed (9 sectors incl. pharma / 16 countries incl. MX/VN/ZA/ID/BR; chokepoints malacca 12·luzon 8·suez 5·gibraltar 5·panama 3·hormuz 1·taiwan-strait 1) + **generated MATURITY.md scorecard** (R0→R1 checklist 15/15) + static did.json/profile (public/actor/tatara, resolvable fallback) + **self-validating seed** (ontology↔seed integrity invariants: every attr declared, ids unique, coords in range, one-capacity-unit-per-sector rollup precondition, flow endpoints resolve) + **first-class `:chokepoint/*` geographic nodes** (7 seed nodes plotted as diamond markers on the globes — the shared map anchor for watari/watatsuna, referential-completeness test-pinned); 56 tests / 5,095 assertions green" :status "🟡 R0" :adr "2606171800" :date "06-17"}
 {:section "Tier-B actors (each: ADR + manifest + cells + lex)" :item "torifune 鳥船" :purpose "**zero-net-carbon open launch-vehicle manufacturing + Transparent space access** — the 船大工 of the sky (funadaiku/sarutahiko/giemon build-pattern pointed at space access; the charter-clean SpaceX inversion). Designs the reusable open-design **Ama 天 class** (two-stage hydrolox) + plant + ascent/staging/recovery GNC sim on kami-genesis; builds the bus subaru 昴 operates; disposal plans feed hoshimori 星守 stewardship. **G1 = civilian launch ONLY, NEVER a weapon-delivery / ballistic-strike vehicle** — depressed/suborbital-strike trajectories + MIRV/PBV buses + kinetic RV + FOBS + munition payloads are STRUCTURALLY UNREPRESENTABLE (`:traj/class`/`:payload/class` enums have no strike/munition member; `check_g1` refuses, test-enforced) (§1.12 Transparent-Force + Rider §2(a)); **G2** zero-net-carbon propellant only (green-H₂ hydrolox / kamado synthetic-methalox net≤0, MEASURED); **G3** open-design + dividend-coupled (ADR-2606032130); **G4** Transparent (open + on-chain flight log + 1 SBT=1 vote); **G5** debris-responsibility (mandatory per-mission disposal, refuses a mission with none); **G6** no-server-key (sim dry-run, actual launch Council+operator-DID gated). `launch-vehicle-ontology`; pure-stdlib pywasm-ready (`ascent_sim` Tsiolkovsky Δv + `carbon_balance` + `disposal_plan` + `datom_emit` EAVT) + Ama seed (18 nodes/13 縁; +3,359 m/s Δv margin to LEO, net 0 kgCO₂e) + `wasm/README.md` componentize-py design + **7 tests green** (incl. `test_g1_no_strike_profile`); .cljc port + live legs gated" :status "🟡 R0+R1+R2" :adr "2606162355" :date "06-16"}
 {:section "Tier-B actors (each: ADR + manifest + cells + lex)" :item "subaru 昴" :purpose "**Transparent connectivity-commons satellite constellation** (Starlink/OneWeb inversion) — a connectivity COMMONS, not a subscription ISP; the payload torifune 鳥船 launches, observed by hoshimori 星守 for stewardship; orbital sibling of watatsuna (cable) / tsutae (terminal) / noroshi (photonics links). Connectivity delivered as **§1.16 Social Security in-kind** (covenantal-universal, to the unconnected + disaster zones) — cash≡0, no-ads, no-subscription. Operates spacecraft (unlike hoshimori) but ONLY Transparently. **G1 = connectivity COMMONS, NEVER a surveillance / targeting / military-C2 platform** — NO DPI / user-geolocation-as-product / ISR-targeting-relay; military-exclusive C2 + jam-as-weapon UNREPRESENTABLE (no `:link/dpi`/`:user/location`/`:relay/targeting` attribute; `check_g1` refuses, test-enforced) (§1.12 + Rider §2(a),(c)); **G2** no person-tracking / reciprocal-symmetric — content E2E-encrypted (com.etzhayyim.encrypted), routed-but-unread; **G3** non-profit/no-ads/cash≡0 (no `:subscription`/`:ad-supported` entitlement representable); **G4** Transparent (open bus+protocol + on-chain ops log + 1 SBT=1 vote); **G5** orbital stewardship (low-deorbit-debt + disposal + darksat night-sky, couples hoshimori); **G8** no-server-key (live ops Council+operator-DID gated). `constellation-ontology`; pure-stdlib pywasm-ready (`link_budget` + `coverage` §1.16-reach + `stewardship` + `datom_emit` EAVT) + seed (15 nodes/12 縁; all links close, urban baseline excluded from reach) + `wasm/README.md` design + **8 tests green** (incl. `test_g1_no_surveillance_relay`); .cljc port + live legs gated" :status "🟡 R0+R1+R2" :adr "2606162355" :date "06-16"}
 {:section "Tier-B actors (each: ADR + manifest + cells + lex)" :item "jinushi 地主" :purpose "**world land/building ownership ACQUISITION mirror** (clj-native; data-acquisition feeder of the land-sovereignty stack ADR-2605192100 §1.11 + 2605192245). The upstream observational mirror the on-chain LandRegistry lacked: measures *how much of the world's land we have data on, who holds it, where the 取-concentration is* → routed to commons-return. **Multi-source**: Wikidata national parks/nature reserves (public land; sanitized vs a real WDQS country-area denominator → **honest 85 countries / 6.20M km² = 4.17%**, corrected down from an un-sanitized 6.67% by dropping P2046 unit-error/marine outliers) + Wikidata buildings w/ owner+floors+height (**2,405 buildings / 19 countries / 1,389 owners**; two 取-concentration lenses — by #buildings = rail operators, by **total FLOORS** = real-estate developers 三井不動産/三菱地所) + **NYC PLUTO gov cadastre** (Socrata, public domain; parcel owner+floors **incl natural persons**) + **GLEIF** authoritative company linkage (owner LEI → kabuto/uchiwake/kanjō; QID → keizu/tsumugi; **221 owners → 690 buildings**). **Reframed public-record gate** (the constitution bans *asymmetric/monetized* surveillance, NOT personal data — Rider v3.1 §2(c)/ADR-2606082400; affirms 相互監視): P1 public-record provenance + P2 reciprocal-symmetric + P3 map-not-target/non-monetized; per-jurisdiction `jurisdiction.cljc` gate (bulk-public SE/US/GB/IE/NL/NO vs restricted DE/AT/CH Grundbuch/FR vs per-parcel JP/KR vs honest :unknown); natural persons representable from public registries (anonymized in the published KG, named raw stored in repo per operator directive). **Maturity**: per-source reliability 信頼度 (`confidence.cljc`, trust-weighted conflict resolution) + as-of diff 差分 (`diff.cljc`) + CID content-addressing (`cid.cljc`) + integrity `verify.cljc` + canonical Datom log (`emit_real.cljc`) + capstone `digest.cljc`. G3 = jinushi asserts no transfer/mint (only the on-chain LandRegistry moves land, member donation, no-server-key). Data in `80-data/jinushi-land/` (datalad substrate, ADR-2605241500; raw acquired data committed + CID-provenanced); WDQS-load-safe (snapshot = SoT, loop never queries WDQS; polite operator `fetch_wdqs.sh`). 14 `.cljc` methods + 70 tests / ~290 assertions green" :status "🟢 R1" :adr "2606162000" :date "06-16"}
